  "coverage": {
    "mode": "explicit-classified",
    "gaps": [
      "a $ref target, a server url, an operationId, a summary and a parameter name are the *value* of a configuration key; omega-json and omega-yaml publish that value as an attribute, and an overlay can only compare an attribute for equality -- it cannot render one into a canonical key, so those constructs cannot be named or related here",
      "a component under components/<section> cannot be told apart from a key nested deeper inside it: fact_join_by_span with `within` reaches every enclosing key, not the immediate parent, so components/schemas, components/responses and the rest are not emitted",
      "templated/generated specifications and runtime server behavior remain terminal external evidence outside static Framework rule scope"
    ]
  },
